  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Living Fog</em></p>\n<p>You can create incredibly dense fog that can be triggered to erupt in a vapor explosion. For an additional 3 CE when you create an area of <em>Cursed Fog</em>, you make the fog incredibly thick. As an action, you can cause the fog to detonate in a vapor explosion. All creatures within the fog other than yourself must make a Constitution saving throw, taking twice your Cursed Energy modifier in d8s of cold damage or half as much damage on a success as a blue explosion rips through, igniting the fog.</p>",
